<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no">
<title>DNA Globe — The DNA Nanotechnology World</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#F6F0E4; --paper2:#FBF7EE; --panel:rgba(251,247,238,.94);
  --ink:#3A342B; --muted:#6E6455; --faint:#9C907C;
  --rule:#DCD1BB; --rule2:#C7B99E;
  --serif:"Fraunces",Georgia,"Iowan Old Style",serif;
  --sans:"Inter",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}
body{
  background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--sans);
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; overscroll-behavior:none;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(1200px 700px at 78% -10%, rgba(255,246,224,.9), transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(900px 600px at 5% 100%, rgba(226,235,226,.7), transparent 70%);
}
canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;touch-action:none;cursor:grab}
canvas.drag{cursor:grabbing}
#stage{position:fixed;inset:0}

/* ---------- masthead ---------- */
#top{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;padding:20px 214px 30px 24px;pointer-events:none;z-index:6;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(246,240,228,.96),rgba(246,240,228,.55) 58%,transparent);}
.kicker{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--faint);margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600}
h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.9vw,2rem);font-weight:500;margin:0;
  line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h1 em{font-style:italic;color:#1B7A8C}
.sub{margin:9px 0 0;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);max-width:56ch;line-height:1.55}
#stats{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint)}
#stats b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;font-family:var(--serif)}

/* ---------- signature ---------- */
#credit{position:fixed;top:20px;right:26px;z-index:8;text-align:right;pointer-events:none;
  font-family:var(--serif);max-width:186px}
#credit .lbl{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.22em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);font-weight:600}
#credit b{display:block;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:500;font-style:italic;color:#4A4238;
  margin:3px 0 5px;letter-spacing:.005em;white-space:nowrap}
#credit .role{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);
  font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;border-top:1px solid var(--rule2);padding-top:5px}
#credit .loc{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);font-weight:600;margin-top:3px}

/* ---------- shared panel look ---------- */
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:16px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(90,75,45,.10), 0 1px 0 #fff inset;}

/* ---------- controls ---------- */
#ctl{position:fixed;left:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:7;width:274px;max-width:calc(100vw - 48px);overflow:hidden}
#ctl .hd{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}
#ctl .hd b{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}
#ctl .body{padding:13px 15px 15px;max-height:min(58vh,470px);overflow-y:auto}
#ctl.min{width:auto}
#ctl.min .hd{border-bottom:0}
#ctl.min .body{display:none}
#ctl.max .body{max-height:calc(100vh - 176px)}
.hdbtns{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.iconbtn{width:24px;height:24px;padding:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid var(--rule2);border-radius:7px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.iconbtn:hover{border-color:#1B7A8C;color:#1B7A8C}
.iconbtn svg{width:12px;height:12px;display:block}
#search{width:100%;background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid var(--rule2);border-radius:10px;
  color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;padding:9px 11px;outline:none}
#search:focus{border-color:#1B7A8C;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(27,122,140,.12)}
#results{list-style:none;margin:9px 0 0;padding:0;max-height:180px;overflow-y:auto}
#results li{padding:8px 9px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
#results li:hover{background:#EFE7D6}
.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto}
#results .rc{margin-left:auto;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);white-space:nowrap}
.sect{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);
  margin:18px 0 9px;font-weight:600}
.sect span{float:right;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none;font-weight:400;cursor:pointer;color:#1B7A8C}
.sect span:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.chip{font-size:11px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--rule2);
  color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;user-select:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  background:#fffdf8;font-family:var(--sans)}
.chip .sw{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}
.chip.off{opacity:.36}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--faint)}
#countrybox{max-height:150px;overflow-y:auto;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;padding:8px;background:#fffdf8}
.toggles{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;margin-top:4px}
.tg{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
.tg input{appearance:none;width:34px;height:19px;border-radius:20px;background:#DDD2BC;position:relative;
  outline:none;cursor:pointer;flex:0 0 auto;transition:background .18s}
.tg input:checked{background:#1B7A8C}
.tg input::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:15px;height:15px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#fff;transition:transform .18s;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.tg input:checked::after{transform:translateX(15px)}
.btn{font-size:11px;background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid var(--rule2);color:var(--muted);
  padding:6px 10px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--sans)}
.btn:hover{border-color:#1B7A8C;color:#1B7A8C}

/* ---------- info panel ---------- */
#info{position:fixed;right:24px;top:104px;z-index:7;width:352px;max-width:calc(100vw - 48px);
  max-height:calc(100vh - 150px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px);pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .24s,transform .24s}
#info.on{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}
#info .ih{padding:16px 18px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);position:relative}
#info .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);font-weight:600}
#info h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:20px;font-weight:500;margin:7px 0 0;line-height:1.2;padding-right:28px}
#info .inst{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.45}
#info .loc{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:4px}
#close{position:absolute;top:13px;right:13px;background:none;border:0;color:var(--faint);font-size:20px;
  line-height:1;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px}
#close:hover{color:var(--ink);background:#EFE7D6}
#back{background:none;border:0;color:#1B7A8C;font-size:11.5px;cursor:pointer;padding:0;margin-bottom:9px;display:none}
#back:hover{text-decoration:underline}
#info .ib{padding:15px 18px 18px;overflow-y:auto}
.areachip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;
  border:1px solid currentColor;margin-bottom:12px}
.areachip .sw{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.role{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;color:#4A4238}
.note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);margin:11px 0 0;line-height:1.6}
.lk{margin-top:18px}
.lk .h{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:9px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:600}
.lk .h i{width:18px;height:0;border-top:2.4px solid;display:inline-block}
.lk ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.lk li{padding:8px 9px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.lk li:hover{background:#EFE7D6}
.lk li .w{margin-left:auto;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);white-space:nowrap}
.lk li .sub2{display:block;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:2px}
.empty{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--faint);font-style:italic}
.chain{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:7px}
.chain b{font-weight:500;color:#4A4238;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--rule2)}
.chain b:hover{color:#1B7A8C;border-bottom-color:#1B7A8C}
.chain b.me{color:#1B7A8C;border-bottom:0;cursor:default}
.chain em{color:var(--faint);font-style:normal;margin:0 6px}

/* ---------- notes & disclaimer ---------- */
.lnk{background:none;border:0;padding:0;font:inherit;color:#1B7A8C;cursor:pointer;
  text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}
.lnk:hover{color:#8A3A2E}
.mini{font-size:11px;color:var(--faint);line-height:1.55;margin:0}
#legal{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:6px;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:6;margin:0;
  font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.02em;white-space:nowrap;
  pointer-events:none}
#legal .lnk{pointer-events:auto;font-size:10.5px}
#notes{position:fixed;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.97);z-index:11;
  width:min(430px,calc(100vw - 28px));max-height:calc(100vh - 60px);overflow-y:auto;
  padding:22px 24px 20px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s}
#notes.on{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1);pointer-events:auto}
#notes h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:19px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 12px;padding-right:26px}
#notes p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.62;color:#4A4238;margin:0 0 11px}
#notes p b{font-weight:600;color:#2B2620}
#notes .mail{margin-top:15px;padding-top:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:12.5px}
#notes .mail a{color:#1B7A8C;font-weight:600;word-break:break-all}
#notes .mail span{color:var(--faint);font-size:11.5px}
#notesclose{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;background:none;border:0;color:var(--faint);
  font-size:21px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px}
#notesclose:hover{color:var(--ink);background:#EFE7D6}

/* ---------- tooltip / legend ---------- */
#tip{position:fixed;z-index:9;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .12s;
  background:#FBF7EE;border:1px solid var(--rule2);border-radius:11px;padding:9px 12px;
  font-size:12px;max-width:270px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(90,75,45,.18)}
#tip.on{opacity:1}
#tip b{display:block;font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:13px}
#tip .t2{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:3px}
#tip ul{margin:7px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55}
#kinds{position:fixed;right:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:6;padding:13px 15px}
#kinds .t{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:9px}
#kinds .r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
#hint{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:26px;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:5;font-size:11.5px;
  color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.04em;text-align:center;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .4s}

@media (max-width:960px){
  #top{padding:14px 134px 22px 16px}
  #credit{top:14px;right:16px;max-width:126px}
  #credit b{font-size:13px}
  #credit .lbl{font-size:8.5px}
  #credit .role{font-size:9px}
  #credit .loc{font-size:8.5px}
  .sub{display:none}
  #kinds,#hint,#legal{display:none}
  #ctl{left:12px;right:12px;bottom:12px;width:auto}
  #ctl .body{max-height:40vh}
  #ctl.max .body{max-height:calc(100vh - 200px)}
  #ctl.min{width:auto;right:auto}
  #info{left:12px;right:12px;top:auto;bottom:12px;width:auto;max-height:66vh;transform:translateY(12px)}
  #info.on{transform:none}
  #info.on ~ #ctl{display:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="stage"><canvas id="c"></canvas></div>

<div id="top">
  <p class="kicker">DNA Globe</p>
  <h1>The DNA nanotechnology world, <em>lab by lab</em></h1>
  <p class="sub">Every institution sits at its real place on Earth. Open one to see who works there, then pick a person to trace their academic family tree across the map.</p>
  <div id="stats"></div>
</div>

<div id="credit">
  <span class="lbl">Made by</span>
  <b>Abhishek Kumar</b>
  <span class="role">PhD &middot; University of Toronto</span>
  <span class="loc">Canada</span>
</div>

<div id="info" class="card">
  <div class="ih">
    <button id="close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <button id="back">&larr; back to institution</button>
    <div class="eyebrow" id="i-eyebrow"></div>
    <h2 id="i-name"></h2>
    <p class="inst" id="i-inst"></p>
    <div class="loc" id="i-loc"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ib" id="i-body"></div>
</div>

<div id="ctl" class="card">
  <div class="hd">
    <b>Find &amp; filter</b>
    <div class="hdbtns">
      <button class="btn" id="reset">Reset</button>
      <button class="iconbtn" id="maxbtn" title="Maximise" aria-label="Maximise panel"></button>
      <button class="iconbtn" id="minbtn" title="Minimise" aria-label="Minimise panel"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="body">
    <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search a person, lab or country…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    <ul id="results"></ul>
    <div class="sect">Research focus</div>
    <div class="chips" id="areachips"></div>
    <div class="sect">Country <span id="ctyall">all / none</span></div>
    <div id="countrybox"><div class="chips" id="countrychips"></div></div>
    <div class="sect">About</div>
    <p class="mini">Educational use only. Names may be missing; borders are illustrative and
      not official. <button class="lnk" data-notes>Notes &amp; contact</button></p>
    <div class="sect">Map</div>
    <div class="toggles">
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-spin" checked>Slow rotation</label>
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-moon" checked>Moon (hides when you zoom in)</label>
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-net">Show every lineage link</label>
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-names" checked>Institution names</label>
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-countries" checked>Country names</label>
      <label class="tg"><input type="checkbox" id="t-states" checked>State &amp; province borders</label>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<p id="legal">Educational use only &middot; borders are illustrative &middot;
  <button class="lnk" data-notes>notes &amp; contact</button></p>

<div id="notes" class="card">
  <button id="notesclose" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
  <h3>About this map</h3>
  <p>This map is made for <b>educational purposes only</b>.</p>
  <p>The roster is a curated snapshot, not a complete census. Some researchers, labs and
     companies are certainly <b>missing</b>, and titles or affiliations may be out of date &mdash;
     people at this career stage move often. Lineage links are only drawn where a source
     stated them.</p>
  <p>State and country borders come from simplified public cartographic data
     (Natural Earth, 1:110m) and are drawn for illustration. They <b>do not represent any
     official, legal or government position on boundaries</b>, and no political claim is
     intended by any line or label.</p>
  <p class="mail">Corrections and additions are very welcome &mdash; please email<br>
     <a href="mailto:kr.abhishekum@gmail.com">kr.abhishekum@gmail.com</a><br>
     <span>Thank you.</span></p>
</div>

<div id="kinds" class="card"><div class="t">How people are linked</div><div id="kindrows"></div></div>
<div id="tip"></div>
<p id="hint">drag to turn the globe &middot; scroll to zoom &middot; tap a marker</p>

